;Description
:Displays the given text as a link with the desired reputation color.

;Syntax
:{{t|rep|reputation|item page link|display text}}
:{{t|reputation|reputation|item page link|display text}}

;Example
:<nowiki>{{reputation|hated|Bloodsail Buccaneers}}</nowiki> : {{reputation|hated|Bloodsail Buccaneers}}
:<nowiki>{{reputation|exalted|Booty Bay|Booty Bay (faction)}}</nowiki> : {{reputation|exalted|Booty Bay|Booty Bay (faction)}}
:<nowiki>{{reputation|friendly}}</nowiki> : {{reputation|friendly}}
:<nowiki>{{reputation|friendly||A H}}</nowiki> : {{reputation|friendly||A H}}

;Possible Values for reputation (first parameter):
{| style="margin-left: 1.75em"
| {{reputation|hated}}<br/>{{reputation|hostile}}<br/>{{reputation|unfriendly}}<br/>{{reputation|neutral}}
| style="padding-left: 2em" | {{reputation|friendly}}<br/>{{reputation|honored}}<br/>{{reputation|revered}}<br/>{{reputation|exalted}}
|}

